        <mxCell id="arch04-65" value="" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#efeaf8;strokeColor=#6a4f9c;strokeWidth=1.2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="52" y="1032" width="18" height="13" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="arch04-66" value="External binary (runtime spawn)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#1c2330;fontSize=11;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="78" y="1030" width="252" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="arch04-67" value="" style="endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=1;strokeColor=#566072;strokeWidth=1.7;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="52" y="1057" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="70" y="1057" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="arch04-68" value="cargo dependency (depends-on)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#1c2330;fontSize=11;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="78" y="1049" width="252" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="arch04-69" value="" style="endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=1;strokeColor=#566072;strokeWidth=1.7;dashed=1;dashPattern=5 3;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="52" y="1076" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="70" y="1076" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="arch04-70" value="dev-dependency / runtime spawn" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#1c2330;fontSize=11;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="78" y="1068" width="252" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="arch04-71" value="&lt;b style=&quot;color:#1c2330&quot;&gt;Reading the graph&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#aab2bf;strokeWidth=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=6;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="360" y="906" width="880" height="167" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="arch04-72" value="• Edges are exact internal Cargo path-dependencies (from each crate's Cargo.toml). An arrow A → B means &quot;A depends on B&quot;." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#45505f;fontSize=10.5;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="372" y="935" width="856" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="arch04-73" value="• sv-crypto-traits is the dependency-light ABI root; sv-types is a leaf with zero crypto deps (so DTOs cannot hold secrets)." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#45505f;fontSize=10.5;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="372" y="954" width="856" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="arch04-74" value="• sv-core takes sv-crypto only as a dev-dependency (dashed) — the production vault is generic over the ABI and FFI-free." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#45505f;fontSize=10.5;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="372" y="973" width="856" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="arch04-75" value="• For legibility, sv-app's direct edges to sv-crypto-traits / sv-crypto / sv-types and desktop's edge to sv-types are omitted" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#45505f;fontSize=10.5;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="372" y="992" width="856" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="arch04-76" value="    (they exist in the manifests). All other edges are drawn." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#45505f;fontSize=10.5;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="372" y="1011" width="856" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="arch04-77" value="• Security-critical = handles key material, performs cryptography, links C/FFI, or executes an external binary." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#45505f;fontSize=10.5;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="372" y="1030" width="856" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="arch04-78" value="• age / ExifTool edges are runtime subprocess spawns (hash-pinned), not compile-time dependencies." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#45505f;fontSize=10.5;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="372" y="1049" width="856" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
